msgid ""
"No swap space found.\n"
"No external drive with a Linux file system (ext4, ...) is mounted - press YELLOW for compressed RAM (zram)."
msgstr ""
"Nije pronađen swap prostor.\n"
"Nije spojen vanjski pogon s Linux datotečnim sustavom (ext4, ...) – ŽUTA za komprimirani RAM (zram)."

msgid ""
"No swap space found.\n"
"No external drive with a Linux file system (ext4, ...) is mounted. Connect a USB drive or hard disk and mount it in the image's drive settings."
msgstr ""
"Nije pronađen swap prostor.\n"
"Nije spojen vanjski pogon s Linux datotečnim sustavom (ext4, ...). Priključite USB pogon ili tvrdi disk i montirajte ga u postavkama diskova imagea."

